      "writtenOn": "2020-04-27T19:19:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not even micro-onos v classic at this point, both charts deploy onos-classic but the new chart is a more fleshed-out deployment that supports multiple instances + newer versions of onos-classic with external Atomix cluster.\n\nSo the options would have to be [old-onos-chart|new-onos-chart|...]\nIt\u0027s not as elegant and not obvious to the user what the differences between the charts are. But the condition is about knowing which chart we are using so that we know which interface we are working against.",
      "parentUuid": "9f20ce98_6a73e535",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 812,
