      "writtenOn": "2020-04-27T19:19:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I feel like that could be added later if there\u0027s a use-case for a more complex Atomix deployment. Right now people using voltha probably don\u0027t know what atomix is or care how it\u0027s deployed, so makes sense to me that the script chooses appropriate defaults.",
      "parentUuid": "24a3f14a_36100d56",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1484,
