    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c62f5290_fb2a5bdf",
        "filename": "voltha",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 1484,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000003
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-04-27T20:36:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the script isn\u0027t meant to be intelligent, i.e. just deploy what it is told. i think the right move is to treat atomix as a separate install, i.e. WITH_ATOMIX. we could set the value of WITH_ATOMIX to y|n|auto|url, where auto means the value is set based on if onos is being deployed and depends on atomix.\n\nwe could use ONOS_CHART and ONOS_CHART_VERSION to potentially get the \"app version\" from helm chart inspect and use that to understand if we are using onos with or without atomix.",
